invalid type: string "Workshop places are assigned in booking order until the session is full.\n\nCANCELLATIONS\nA participant can request a workshop credit if they cancel at least 48 hours before the workshop. Requests made later than that are not eligible for credit. If the museum cancels a workshop, participants receive a full refund for the workshop fee.\n\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\n: \"ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ